WEBVTT

00:00:03.202 --> 00:00:09.068
On Hours and overflow, Overflow queue and Overflow after set the first hop.

00:00:09.068 --> 00:00:13.413
Overflow chain adds more hops, each with its own wait.

00:00:13.413 --> 00:00:16.382
The wait starts again at every hop.

00:00:16.837 --> 00:00:20.919
A caller is never sent back to a queue they have already visited.

00:00:20.919 --> 00:00:24.713
The chain that applies is the one on the queue the caller is

00:00:24.713 --> 00:00:27.875
in now, so a path from A through B to C needs B's

00:00:27.875 --> 00:00:29.370
own chain to name C.

00:00:29.370 --> 00:00:33.740
On Limits, Maximum wait and its action decide what happens to a caller

00:00:33.740 --> 00:00:35.177
who waits too long.

